+/**
+ * MetaLayerShellCapabilities:
+ * @META_LAYER_SHELL_CAPABILITY_NONE: nothing
+ * @META_LAYER_SHELL_CAPABILITY_BACKGROUND: the background layer
+ * @META_LAYER_SHELL_CAPABILITY_PANEL: the bottom and top layers, exclusive
+ *   zones and on_demand keyboard: bars, docks, launchers
+ * @META_LAYER_SHELL_CAPABILITY_OVERLAY: the overlay layer, above full-screen
+ *   windows, and on_demand keyboard
+ * @META_LAYER_SHELL_CAPABILITY_KEYBOARD: exclusive keyboard
+ *
+ * What an application may do with zwlr_layer_shell_v1.
